.. Functionality  : prft F„lligkeitsdatum gegen Buchungsdatum
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..    uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..    uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
..    Argument     meaning
..    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
..
.. Program flow   :
...Includes       :
..*****************************************************************************
..
..*****************************************************************************
.type integer U|xiz     ? _F|defined(U|xiz)
.type integer U|xim     ? _F|defined(U|xim)
..
.continue END           ? M|tzeilen = 0
..
.formula U|xiz          = 0
.formula U|xim          = M|tzeilen
..
!LOOP
.formula U|xiz          = U|xiz + 1
.continue END           ? U|xiz > U|xim
.select screen line 'U|xiz'
.continue LOOP          ? _G|mehr
..
.continue DELETE        ? (M|op^budat > M|zaterm)
.continue DELETE        ? F|empty(M|kobverb) & F|empty(M|bverb)
.continue LOOP
..
!DELETE
.make screen line -o
.formula U|xim          = U|xim - 1
.formula U|xiz          = U|xiz - 1
.continue LOOP
..
!END
.continue
